Here's another very nice trick I (independently) discovered.

As virtually ever player knows, unicorns avoid lining up with you,
otherwise you could easily toss gems at them. This behavior also makes
it difficult to zap wands and spells at them. But they don't take into
account bouncing rays off walls. Here's an example:

-------------
|.....@.....|
+..........%|
-.---------.-

I threw a magic missile to the northeast. It bounced a few times and
hit the white unicorn that is now represented by %. :)

